## Authority Boundary

The owner explicitly authorized exact manifest `459326469b84ba91`, its 259-file blast radius, the
verified rollback procedure, and 30-day archive retention. The canonical transaction completed
within that boundary. Removing the retained archive before or after 2026-09-29 remains a separate
destructive action and is not authorized by this program.

## KISS Boundary

Use one retirement manifest contract and one guarded implementation path. Do not introduce a
server, dual-write mode, generalized repository cleaner, or unrelated `.tool-shed/` purge.

## Program Closeout

All three milestone gates passed. The managed transaction retired all 259 source aliases at
revision 885, deleted exactly the approved source paths, preserved all 456 excluded work files,
and retained verified checkpoint, rollback-export, and source-archive recovery. Full validation
passed after the retirement and the schema-2 Doctor topology check was corrected and qualified.
